"PowerBasedSwitchingHelp" = "When this is on, gfxCardStatus applies the choice for the power source you are using. On Battery and Plugged In can each be Integrated Only, Discrete Only, Dynamic Switching, or Don't Change.\n\nA mode you pick in the status menu stays in effect until you plug in or unplug, choose Resume Automatic Rules, or select a profile. Turning this on, or changing the choice for the power source you are on now, applies immediately. Don't Change leaves the GPU alone and does not fall through to the launch or wake rule. Integrated Only is skipped while an external display or an app is using the discrete GPU.\n\nQuitting gfxCardStatus still returns the Mac to Dynamic Switching.";
